## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

The stock basis is known, but Caraway Seed Oil lacks active composite registry mapping in the current program; strict OAV and release advancement are on hold. No purchase is justified. Verify EB, repair the composite mapping in the integration program, and keep every tincture excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Run a balanced-order, equal-mass and equal-concentration three-arm test: LN-08, LN-01, and a volume-matched zero-caraway control replacing all 40 µL Caraway stock with 40 µL DPG. Assess caraway detectability, cardamom dominance, savory/culinary drift, La Nuit retention, and liking at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

